/mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Chang'e/Cosmetics\"}],\"lore\":{\"backstory\":\"Chang'e is the Moon Palace Immortal, a cheerful girl blessed by the moon goddess with the power to channel lunar energy into devastating meteor showers. She carries a magical jade rabbit companion named Crescent who amplifies her powers. Though she appears young and carefree, Chang'e has lived for centuries in the Moon Palace, watching over the Land of Dawn from above. When the balance of power shifted and darkness threatened to eclipse the moon, Chang'e descended to the mortal realm to restore the light.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"zilong\",\"heroName\":\"Zilong\",\"relationship\":\"Dragon warrior who serves as her protector\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"wanwan\",\"heroName\":\"Wanwan\",\"relationship\":\"Eastern warrior who befriended her on earth\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"pharsa\",\"heroName\":\"Pharsa\",\"relationship\":\"Sky mage whose astral powers rival her lunar magic\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"lunox\",\"heroName\":\"Lunox\",\"relationship\":\"Twilight being whose darkness threatens her moonlight\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"$undefined\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"winRate\":48.35,\"pickRate\":0.71,\"banRate\":0.55},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"winRate\":48.4,\"pickRate\":0.71,\"banRate\":0.54},{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"winRate\":48.21,\"pickRate\":0.69,\"banRate\":0.49},{\"date\":\"2026-09-28\",\"winRate\":47.77,\"pickRate\":0.69,\"banRate\":0.29},{\"date\":\"2026-10-02\",\"winRate\":47.92,\"pickRate\":0.7,\"banRate\":0.3},{\"date\":\"2026-10-09\",\"winRate\":47.93,\"pickRate\":0.72,\"banRate\":0.33},{\"date\":\"2026-10-17\",\"winRate\":47.88,\"pickRate\":0.71,\"banRate\":0.34}]},\"relatedHeroesSlot\":\"$L66\",\"statsSeoSlot\":\"$L67\",\"fieldManualSlot\":\"$L68\"}]\n62:[\"$\",\"$L69\",null,{\"heroName\":\"Chang'e\",\"heroSlug\":\"change\",\"roles\":\"$61:props:hero:role\",\"lanes\":\"$61:props:hero:lane\",\"difficulty\":2,\"winRate\":47.88,\"pickRate\":0.71,\"banRate\":0.34,\"cu