",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-baseline gap-2.5 text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.06em]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-block rounded-sm px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] self-center\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#B07ECC\",\"background\":\"#B07ECC1a\",\"border\":\"1px solid #B07ECC40\"},\"children\":\"Epic\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankCardH3\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"Chang'e\",\"rank\":\"Epic\"}}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"href\":\"/tier-list?rank=epic\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-text-accent hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankTierListLink\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Epic\"}}],\" →\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-muted text-[13px] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceLead\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Epic\",\"name\":\"Chang'e\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"50.36\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid1\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"Chang'e\",\"delta\":\"+2.43%\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"0.91\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid2\"}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"0.92\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceAfter\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Epic\"}}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"article\",\"legend\",{\"className\":\"group relative min-w-0 border border-mlbb-gold/15 bg-surface-1/40 p-3.5 pl-5 md:p-4 md:pl-6 transition-colors hover:border-mlbb-gold/30\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[3px]\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"linear-gradient(to bottom, #4dc9f6, #4dc9f633)\",\"boxShadow\":\"0 0 12px -2px #4dc9f680\"}}],[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1 flex-wrap\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-baseline gap-2.5 text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.06em]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-block rounded-sm px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] self-center\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#4dc9f6\",\"background\":\"#4dc9f61a\",\"border\":\"1px solid #4dc9f640\"},\"children\":\"Legend\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankCardH3\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"Chang'e\",\"rank\":\"Legend\"}}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"href\":\"/tier-list?rank=legend\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-text-accent hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankTierListLink\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Legend\"}}],\" →\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-muted text-[13px] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceLead\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Legend\",\"name\":\"Chang'e\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"48.76\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid1\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"Chang'e\",\"delta\":\"+0.83%\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"0.89\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid2\"}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"0.50\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceAfter\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Legend\"}}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"article\",\"mythic\",{\"className\":\"group relative min-w-0 border border-mlbb-gold/15 bg-surface-1/40 p-3.5 pl-5 md:p-4 md:pl-6 transition-colors hover:border-mlbb-gold/30\",\"children\":[\"$La1\",\"$La2\",\"$La3\"]}],\"$La4\",\"$La5\"]}]\n7e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-4\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"If you cannot name which enemy hero you plan to siege out of relevance, Chang'e is the wrong pick.\"}]\n7f:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-1\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"The one thing that makes Chang'e work\"]}]\n80:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Chang'e is not a combo mage. She does not have a rotation that deletes someone in half a second the way Eudora or Aurora do. She is a damage hose: activate Crescent Moon, point Meteor Shower at a lane or a teamfight, and let the sustained stream do the rest.\"}]\n81:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Trouble Maker is the quiet engine underneath the kit. Every time Chang'e deals damage to a target, she stacks a mark that cuts the target's movement speed, up to a deep slow. That sounds mild until you remember Meteor Shower fires dozens of projectiles per channel, and Crescent Moon adds a second stream alongside. By the second wave of meteors the slow is at its floor, and anyone still standing in the lane is wading while the rest of the channel lands. The ultimate does not front-load its damage. It pins you in place: the slow keeps stacking, Genius Wand's shred keeps softening the armor, and the longer the target stays, the worse the math. Enemies who step out at half duration survive with a scratch. Enemies who stay for the full channel die.\"}]\n82:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Crescent Moon (S2) ties everything together. Activating it grants a permanent shield that scales with Total Magic Power, a flat movement speed bonus that persists until the shield breaks, and a temporary movement speed burst every time Chang'e casts any skill. It also transforms Starmoon Shockwave from a single projectile into five, and adds a second meteor stream to Meteor Shower. The shield is the whole trick: it is what lets her stand in range while the slow does its work. You recast Crescent Moon when the shield pops, not on cooldown. Resetting it early replaces a shield that is still intact, and that is the waste.\"}]\n83:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Once that framework clicks, Chang'e stops looking like a mage rotation and starts looking like siege warfare. Activate Crescent Moon, push the wave with enhanced basics, poke with empowered S1, and when a fight erupts or an objective spawns, channel Meteor Shower down the corridor and let the slow hold them in place.\"}]\n84:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-2\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Laning: the first five minutes\"]}]\n85:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Chang'e's lane phase is a mana-discipline exercise. She has the tools to push from level 1, but using them carelessly drains her pool before the first objective fight.\"}]\n86:[\"$\",\"ol\",\"ol-0\",{\"className\":\"list-decimal list-inside text-[#9BA0B4] my-3 space-y-2 ml-2\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Level 1: take S2 first and clear with enhanced basics.\"}],\" Crescent Moon transforms your basic attacks into enhanced projectiles that deal bonus magic damage. That is enough to win the first wave trade against most mids without spending mana on S1. The shield absorbs their return poke. Walk up, auto the wave a few times, walk back behind your ranged minions.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Level 2: take S1 and begin poking through the wave.\"}],\" With Crescent Moon active, Starmoon Shockwave fires five spheres. Aim it so the outer spheres clip the enemy mid behind the creep wave. The center sphere clears range minions while the side spheres stack Trouble Maker on the enemy. Two S1 pokes leave the enemy walking through syrup, which makes the empowered S1 you land at level 3 far more likely to land all five spheres.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Do not burn ult before the first Turtle fight unless a gank is happening.\"}],\" Meteor Shower still costs real mana at level 4, and the cooldown is long enough that using it to clear one wave means you arrive at the Turtle contest with nothing. Save it for objective fights or confirmed kills where your jungler is already committed.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n87:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-10\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"If the enemy jungler ganks before minute 3, your escape is Crescent Moon's movement speed burst on any skill cast plus Flicker. Press S1 in the direction you are running, take the speed burst, Flicker if they follow. Do not stand and ult into a 2v1. The channel locks you in place and the damage needs a few seconds to build, so you die before the stream threatens anyone and waste the cooldown.\"}]\n88:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-3\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"The power spike you are farming toward\"]}]\n89:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-11\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Chang'e's first completed item is Genius Wand, never Clock of Destiny. Clock gives HP and mana sustain, but Chang'e's problem is not sustain. Her problem is that her damage is multiplicative and every point of magic defense on the target reduces it before the multipliers kick in.\"}]\n8a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-12\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Genius Wand's Magic passive reduces the target's magic defense by a stacking amount per hit, up to three stacks. Chang'e stacks it instantly. With Crescent Moon active, Starmoon Shockwave hits five times and Meteor Shower hits dozens. By the third meteor, all three stacks of magic defense reduction are live, and every subsequent hit punches through softened defenses. That reduction is the compounding factor: the same slow stacks that pin a target in the channel are also stacking up the shred, so anyone who stays in the stream gets both slower and softer to the point where the math turns ugly fast.\"}]\n8b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-13\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[\"The spike you are farming toward is \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Genius Wand plus Holy Crystal\"}],\", usually around the 8-to-10 minute window depending on farm and kill participation. Holy Crystal contributes a massive lump of raw Magic Power plus its Mystery passive, which grants a percentage bonus to total Magic Power that scales with level. That multiplier is what flips Chang'e from \\\"annoying poke\\\" to \\\"an ult that kills a squishy who stands in it for two seconds.\\\"\"]}]\n8c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-14\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Before Holy Crystal, Meteor Shower chips. After it, the channel removes anyone who does not respect the danger zone. This is the window where you stop farming mid and start looking for fights at Turtle or in the enemy jungle. Your empowered S1 punishes most gold laners who walk into its path, and your ult, aimed down a jungle corridor, forces enemies to either walk through it or surrender the objective.\"}]\n8d:[\"$\",\"$La6\",null,{\"slot\":\"7246933188\",\"variant\":\"in-article\",\"className\":\"my-8\"}]\n8e:[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Teamfight positioning and target priority\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"The reflex most Chang'e players follow is standing close to the fight and channeling Meteor Shower into the thick of it. That reflex loses games. Meteor Shower fires in a line. If you stand inside the teamfight, the meteors strike the nearest target and stop, which means dumping a full channel into a tank wearing Radiant Armor. Stand at the back edge of the fight and aim the ult through the path the enemy backline is standing in, not at the tank in front of you.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ol\",\"ol-0\",{\"className\":\"list-decimal list-inside text-[#9BA0B4] my-3 space-y-2 ml-2\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Channel from behind your own frontline, aimed at their carries.\"}],\" Meteors pass through allies, so use your tank as a wall. If their tank is between you and their damage dealers, shift your angle until the meteor line clips the carry. Diagonal angles through the side of the fight are almost always better than head-on channels.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Do not walk forward during Meteor Shower.\"}],\" Crescent Moon grants movement speed during the ultimate, which feels like permission to chase. It is a trap. Walking forward moves your meteor line forward, which means the back half of your ult misses the target you started hitting. The movement speed exists for kiting backward when someone dives you, not for pursuing a fleeing target.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Hold S1 for after the ult, not before.\"}],\" If you open with S1 to slow a target before ulting, you spend your only immediate CC. If the target Flickers or dashes out of the channel during those seconds, you have no slow to re-engage. Hold S1 as your follow-up to finish targets who survive the channel with low HP and try to escape.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"If your support is a Tigreal or Atlas who groups the enemy, aim Meteor Shower through the clump before it disperses. The first wave of meteors stacks the slow and the Genius Wand shred on everyone in the clump, and the rest of the channel lands on a group that cannot scatter. A full ult through a three-person group after Atlas ult is Chang'e's fastest teamfight win condition.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"If your support is Estes, you get to push the channel deeper because he can top you off through incidental damage. If your support is Diggie, you do not have that luxury and need to position more conservatively.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-1\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[\"$La7\",\"Itemization: three locks, two conversations\"]}],\"\\n\",\"$La8\",\"\\n\",\"$La9\",\"\\n\",\"$Laa\",\"\\n\",\"$Lab\",\"\\n\",\"$Lac\",\"\\n\",\"$Lad\",\"\\n\",\"$Lae\",\"\\n\",\"$Laf\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb0\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb1\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb2\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb3\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb4\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb5\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb6\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb7\"]\n8f:[\"$\",\"$Lb8\",null,{\"heroName\":\"Chang'e\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"90:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative bg-surface-4 border border-mlbb-gold/20 overflow-hidden card-hover hover:border-mlbb-gold/50\",\"style\":{\"boxShadow\":\"0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative w-14 h-14 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 bg-surface-3\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L6b\",null,{\"src\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e1097b9d3e1d5e9f14600d32e8b18acd.png\",\"alt\":\"Claude - Master Thief\",\"unoptimized\":false,\"priority\":\"$undefined\",\"fetchPriority\":\"$undefined\",\"fill\":true,\"className\":\"object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\",\"sizes\":\"56px\",\"placeholder\":\"blur\",\"blurDataURL\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aW